      "value": [
        "Target is the live session VWAP, worked as a limit order - on each bar j in the trade, the target is VWAP as of the close of bar j-1; a long exits when High[j] >= that target, a short when Low[j] <= it, filled at the target, or at Open[j] when the bar opens already beyond the target",
        "When one bar reaches both the stop and the target, the stop is assumed to fill first",
        "Standing time exit at 14:45 from the deployment profile, before the 15:00 MIS square-off; no position is held overnight"
      ]
    },
